WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.700
Educational information only. Not medical
advice or a substitute for evaluation by a

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.250
qualified healthcare professional.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.114
Welcome to today’s workout. Start with a
two-minute easy walk to warm up.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.353
One minute left. Keep the pace easy.

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:01.000
Ten seconds.

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:15.675
Next exercise. Bodyweight squat. Go to a
comfortable depth. Two sets of ten.

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:20.193
Set one of two.

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:00.971
Rest for thirty seconds.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:24.370
Get ready.

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:30.269
Set two of two.

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:10.971
Rest for thirty seconds.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.370
Get ready.

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:44.121
Next exercise. Glute bridge, with a
two-second hold. Two sets of ten.

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:49.193
Set one of two.

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:49.971
Rest for thirty seconds.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.370
Get ready.

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:19.268
Set two of two.

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:19.971
Rest for thirty seconds.

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:43.370
Get ready.

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:52.585
Next exercise. Straight leg raise. Two
sets of ten each side.

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:58.787
Set one of two, first side.

00:08:41.800 --> 00:08:43.472
Switch sides.

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:58.885
Set one of two, second side.

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:43.971
Rest for thirty seconds.

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:07.370
Get ready.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.873
Set two of two, first side.

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:58.472
Switch sides.

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:13.959
Set two of two, second side.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:12:00.774
Cool-down. Walk at an easy pace for ninety
seconds.

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:18.000
Ten seconds.

00:13:26.900 --> 00:13:32.732
That is today’s workout. Nice work today.
Remember, stop if pain is more than mild.
